              "name": "t:names.heading",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>The Watson family have been growing plants on the<br/>Isle of Man since 1929. we offer an extensive<br/>selection of garden plants including plants that are<br/>grown on site.  Our range includes: trees, shrubs,<br/>hedging, specimen plants, topiary, fruit trees and<br/>bushes, bulbs and tubers, perennials, vegetables,<br/>herbs, bedding plants, pre-planted hanging baskets<br/>and pots (or refills). We also have a selection of<br/>quality terracotta and glazed pots and we sell a<br/>range of composts including peat free.</p>",
